cessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rpIJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8480372-8299-4734-ae32-be587a7664a0_1200x669.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rpIJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8480372-8299-4734-ae32-be587a7664a0_1200x669.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rpIJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8480372-8299-4734-ae32-be587a7664a0_1200x669.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rpIJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8480372-8299-4734-ae32-be587a7664a0_1200x669.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><strong>Your AI agent has database access. Can you <a href=\"https://fandf.co/4wXsoWS\">tell</a> what it did?</strong> Give an agent a Postgres login and it looks like any other role - a shared, long-lived credential with no real way to know which agent ran which query. The modern fix is identity: access scoped to the task that expires when it’s done, and an audit trail tying every query to a specific agent (and the human behind it). That’s the model Teleport is built on - identity-based access to your infrastructure, no static credentials. Worth a read if agents are near your production data. <a href=\"https://fandf.co/4wXsoWS\">Read more</a> · Sponsored by Teleport. #ad</figcaption></figure></div><p>In my experience, <strong>good agent work depends on two abilities</strong>:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Deep expertise:</strong> you understand the problem domain well enough to define a good outcome. Understanding your user/product/business is part of this.</p></li><li><p><strong>Applied judgment:</strong> use your taste to turn this into a clear, testable plan by choosing the right context, constraints, tests and verification.</p></li></ol><p>To build these the skills I’d practice are decision making, specifying, steering and verifying.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ep